# Build-context exclusions for the root Dockerfile (ADR-0023).
#
# This file is load-bearing for correctness, not just image size. The
# Dockerfile's `COPY src/ ./` would otherwise copy whatever the host happens
# to have in src/ — and the first entry below is the one that matters most:
#
#   src/.env is gitignored but PRESENT on every developer's disk. Copied into
#   the image it would sit at /var/www/html/.env, where Laravel reads it in
#   preference to nothing — silently overriding every variable Railway
#   injects. A deploy would come up pointed at `db` (the compose hostname),
#   with APP_DEBUG=true and the local APP_KEY. That failure looks like
#   "Railway ignored my variables," three layers from the cause.
#
# Everything else here is either rebuilt inside the image (vendor, node_modules,
# public/build) or has no business on a host (tests, coverage, scanner output).

# --- Secrets. Never in an image. -------------------------------------------
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/auth.json
**/*.pem

# --- Rebuilt by the Dockerfile's own stages --------------------------------
# vendor/ comes from the composer stage, node_modules never reaches runtime,
# public/build comes from the assets stage. Copying the host's copies would
# both bloat the context and risk shipping platform-specific binaries built
# against a different libc (the local image is Debian, runtime is Alpine).
src/vendor/
src/node_modules/
src/public/build/
src/public/hot
src/public/fonts-manifest.dev.json

# Filament's published assets — regenerated by `filament:upgrade`, which the
# Dockerfile runs. The host's copies drift from the installed package version.
src/public/css/
src/public/js/
src/public/fonts/

# The storage:link symlink is created at container start (it points at an
# absolute path that only resolves inside the image).
src/public/storage

# --- Runtime state, never source ------------------------------------------
src/storage/framework/cache/
src/storage/framework/sessions/
src/storage/framework/views/
src/storage/framework/testing/
src/storage/logs/
src/storage/pail/
src/storage/*.key
# storage/app/public/demo is NOT excluded: the 182 committed demo images are
# what let the seeded catalogue render without a volume. ADR-0023.
src/storage/app/private/
src/storage/app/livewire-tmp/

# --- Test and tooling surface that must not reach a deployed host ----------
src/tests/
src/phpunit.xml
src/phpunit.browser.xml
src/pint.json
src/phpstan.neon
src/.phpunit.cache/
src/.phpunit.result.cache
src/coverage-html/
src/coverage.xml
src/.pest/

# --- Repo metadata and local-only tooling ---------------------------------
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
docs/
misc/
scratchpad/
online-store/
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CLAUDE.md
src/CLAUDE.md
src/.ai/
src/.claude/
docker-compose.yml
# The dev image and its config — the runtime image is built from
# docker/production/ only, and those two files are COPYed by explicit path.
docker/php/
docker/nginx/
docker/mysql/

# --- Editor / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
src/_ide_helper.php
src/.phpactor.json
